      "title": "Qt: Check the results of dynamic_cast",
      "message": "Qt: Check the results of dynamic_cast\n\nNone of these should fail, but it's better practice to check.\nAlso, there's no reason here to do a C-style cast before the\ndynamic_cast when we already have a class. (It's different when\nit's an interface to the C code that uses a void* tapinfo pointer.)\n\nCoverity CIDs 1450361, 1450491, 1450615, 1450909, 1450921, 1475966\n",
